@*
    The recovery codes of an account, on the one page view that shows them. The application keeps
    only their hashes, so it cannot show them a second time.
*@

<h2>Your recovery codes</h2>

<p>Keep these codes somewhere safe, away from your phone. If you lose your authenticator app, each of them signs you in once in its place.</p>

<ul class="recovery-codes">
    @foreach (var recoveryCode in Codes)
    {
        <li><code>@recoveryCode</code></li>
    }
</ul>

<p><strong>They are shown only now.</strong> Write them down or print this page before you leave it.</p>

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public IReadOnlyList<string> Codes { get; set; } = [];
}
